# mbsync (isync) configuration — Gmail
# Managed by chezmoi — do not edit directly
# Passwords fetched at runtime via 1Password CLI

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User {{ .email }}
PassCmd "op read 'op://Private/Gmail NeoMutt/password'"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path {{ .xdgDataDir }}/mail/gmail/
Inbox {{ .xdgDataDir }}/mail/gmail/Inbox

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns * ![Gmail]/All\ Mail ![Gmail]/Important ![Gmail]/Spam
Create Near
Expunge None
SyncState *
